---
import { BUSINESS } from '../business'
import Fill from '../components/Fill.astro'
import Support from '../components/Support.astro'
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro'
---
<Legal title="Contact" description="How to reach Stoke’s support." updated="October 16, 2026">
  <p>
    Email <Support /> for help with your account, billing,
    refunds, privacy requests, or to report a security issue. A person reads every message, and we reply within two
    business days.
  </p>
  <h2>Before you write</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Connecting Stripe:</strong> in Stoke, go to Settings → Your Stripe accounts → Connect with Stripe. If an
      account shows “Disconnected in Stripe”, choose Reconnect.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Connecting Gmail:</strong> Settings → Gmail → Connect Gmail. To stop Stoke sending, choose Disconnect, or
      remove Stoke at <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Cancelling or a refund:</strong> see the <a href="/refunds/">refund and cancellation policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Deleting your account:</strong> Settings → Delete your account.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Company</h2>
  <p>
    {BUSINESS.product} is run by <Fill value={BUSINESS.legalName} label="legal entity name" />,
    <Fill value={BUSINESS.address} label="mailing address" />.
  </p>
</Legal>
